// Concentrate (OreProcessing): the heavy fraction off a concentrator, one per ore, 5 units of metal
// each, a slot 640. Smelts whole in every furnace (set in code), except a sulfide's, which smelts only
// once roasted. Marked disabled with the switch off.
// Texture: a fine powder shows its mineral's streak, so each is the ore's nugget texture with a crushed one
// blended over it for grain (blend modes: EnumColorBlendMode). The sulfides and dark oxides, and the placer
// black sands, take crushed galena multiplied ("*", dark); the pale or coloured ores have their own keys,
// above "*" (first match wins): screened lighter (malachite, azurite, the white zinc and lead carbonates,
// rhodochrosite, vanadinite, limonite, sphalerite), wulfenite overlaid with quartz, hematite crushed
// hematite's red-brown, and native copper lightened and overlaid with bauxite's copper.
